{"id": "ae50021da99746ca9fa74c35f04ecd3c", "card_id": "57d6f2ab1c8847519f8932749dce0c11::statement", "entry_id": "57d6f2ab1c8847519f8932749dce0c11", "mode": "statement", "started_at": "2026-09-04T14:34:26.321243+00:00", "attempt": "Let $G$ be a group and $A$ be a set.  A group action is a function $\\phi:G\\times A\\to A$ such that\n1. $\\forall a\\in A, \\phi(1_G, a) = a$.\n2. $\\forall g,h\\in G, \\forall a\\in A, \\phi(gh,a) = \\phi(g,\\phi(h,a))$.", "confidence": 3, "elapsed_ms": 112964, "overt": true, "hints_used": 0, "graded_at": "2026-09-04T14:36:15.847639+00:00", "grade": 1, "schedule": {"due_at": "2026-09-05T14:36:15.847639+00:00", "last_reviewed_at": "2026-09-04T14:36:15.847639+00:00", "last_grade": 1, "last_elapsed_ms": 112964, "stability_days": 1.0, "difficulty": 5.2, "repetitions": 1, "lapses": 0, "last_confidence": 3, "last_calibration": 1, "scheduler": {"model": "discounted-bayesian-retention-v1", "target_grade": "good-or-easy", "target_probability": 0.9, "calibrated": false, "source": "fallback", "observations": 0, "effective_observations": 0.0, "interval_factor": 1.0, "interval_days": 1, "bounded_direction": null, "calibrated_interval_used": false}}, "calibration_event_version": 1}
{"id": "fb4ce6872eeb421d82be097916175a05", "card_id": "0edb913ab5e54826b108b87a11eb8406::statement", "entry_id": "0edb913ab5e54826b108b87a11eb8406", "mode": "statement", "started_at": "2026-09-04T14:37:31.553064+00:00", "attempt": "A field $\\F$ is an abelian group under $+:\\F\\times \\F\\to \\F$ with\n1. $\\F^\\times = \\F\\setminus \\set{0}$ is an abelian group under $\\cdot:\\F\\times \\F\\to \\F$.\n2. (a+b)c = ac+bc.", "confidence": 3, "elapsed_ms": 75548, "overt": true, "hints_used": 0, "graded_at": "2026-09-04T14:37:52.119358+00:00", "grade": 2, "schedule": {"due_at": "2026-09-06T14:37:52.119358+00:00", "last_reviewed_at": "2026-09-04T14:37:52.119358+00:00", "last_grade": 2, "last_elapsed_ms": 75548, "stability_days": 2.0, "difficulty": 4.85, "repetitions": 1, "lapses": 0, "last_confidence": 3, "last_calibration": 1, "scheduler": {"model": "discounted-bayesian-retention-v1", "target_grade": "good-or-easy", "target_probability": 0.9, "calibrated": false, "source": "fallback", "observations": 0, "effective_observations": 0.0, "interval_factor": 1.0, "interval_days": 2, "bounded_direction": null, "calibrated_interval_used": false}}, "calibration_event_version": 1}
{"id": "78810efb682548a5a93c9270d2a5f70c", "card_id": "eecb200ab5694ee2b08a66080bcf5bb1::statement", "entry_id": "eecb200ab5694ee2b08a66080bcf5bb1", "mode": "statement", "started_at": "2026-09-04T14:40:32.390554+00:00", "attempt": "Let $\\F$ be a field.  A vector space is an abelian group $V$ under $+:V\\times V\\to V$ and\n1. $\\F\\times V\\to V$ is a left action.\n2. $\\forall a,b\\in F, v,w\\in V, (a+b)(v+w) = av + aw + bv + bw$.", "confidence": 3, "elapsed_ms": 160031, "overt": true, "hints_used": 0, "graded_at": "2026-09-04T14:41:09.398062+00:00", "grade": 2, "schedule": {"due_at": "2026-09-06T14:41:09.398062+00:00", "last_reviewed_at": "2026-09-04T14:41:09.398062+00:00", "last_grade": 2, "last_elapsed_ms": 160031, "stability_days": 2.0, "difficulty": 4.85, "repetitions": 1, "lapses": 0, "last_confidence": 3, "last_calibration": 1, "scheduler": {"model": "discounted-bayesian-retention-v1", "target_grade": "good-or-easy", "target_probability": 0.9, "calibrated": false, "source": "fallback", "observations": 0, "effective_observations": 0.0, "interval_factor": 1.0, "interval_days": 2, "bounded_direction": null, "calibrated_interval_used": false}}, "calibration_event_version": 1}
{"id": "5a0d09048c864d0b950a62bab0cde207", "card_id": "c58321af7ee94497a0af97894c93fff1::statement", "entry_id": "c58321af7ee94497a0af97894c93fff1", "mode": "statement", "started_at": "2026-09-04T14:42:07.892015+00:00", "attempt": "Let $G$ be a group and $M$ be a subgroup of $G$. $M$ is maximal if for every subgroup $H$ of $G$,\n$$\nM \\subseteq H \\subseteq G \\implies M=H \\text{ or } H=G.\n$$", "confidence": 3, "elapsed_ms": 58361, "overt": true, "hints_used": 0, "graded_at": "2026-09-04T14:42:18.757643+00:00", "grade": 3, "schedule": {"due_at": "2026-09-08T14:42:18.757643+00:00", "last_reviewed_at": "2026-09-04T14:42:18.757643+00:00", "last_grade": 3, "last_elapsed_ms": 58361, "stability_days": 4.0, "difficulty": 4.65, "repetitions": 1, "lapses": 0, "last_confidence": 3, "last_calibration": 0, "scheduler": {"model": "discounted-bayesian-retention-v1", "target_grade": "good-or-easy", "target_probability": 0.9, "calibrated": false, "source": "fallback", "observations": 0, "effective_observations": 0.0, "interval_factor": 1.0, "interval_days": 4, "bounded_direction": null, "calibrated_interval_used": false}}, "calibration_event_version": 1}
